      "title": "Digital Workplace & Office Productivity",
      "description": "Master essential workplace software. Learn word processing design hierarchies, spreadsheet formulas (=SUM, =AVERAGE, =COUNT, =IF), charts, and cloud collaboration.",
      "icon": "file-text",
